    "physical_description": "Sarong (Kain Pandjang) of cotton batik. Cotton waxed with the tjanting and dyed indigo and light brown with white reserved. The field is patterned with stylised objects, predominantly wing (lar) and snake (naga) motifs, repeated on a background of conventional leaves. The head (kepala) and borders are patterned with a foliage (semen) motif,  The intervals between the triangles (tumpal) of the kepala have conventional rosettes reserved.",
